  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "shannon.cox@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>Stryker Corporation (NYSE:SYK) announced that its Board of Directors has declared a quarterly dividend of&nbsp;$0.47&nbsp;per share payable on&nbsp;July 31, 2018&nbsp;to shareholders of record at the close of business on&nbsp;June 29, 2018, representing an increase of approximately 11% versus the prior year and unchanged from the previous quarter.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>See full release <a href=\"https://investors.stryker.com/press-releases/news-details/2018/Stryker-declares-a-047-per-share-quarterly-dividend-20180502000000/default.aspx\">here</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Mar 11 2019 18:39:38 GMT+0000",
